  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pambazuko Piggery Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to expand Pambazukosmarkets through market research andpublicity campaigns; to construct a centralized holding pen; and to purchase an improved breed of pig and high quality pig feeds. Pambazukomembers will also receive training in best practices for livestock management; financial management and good governance.</narrative>
  </description>
